1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:02,794
Air bekas mandimu bisa kembali ke sungai

2
00:00:02,814 --> 00:00:03,780
jauh lebih bersih.

3
00:00:03,950 --> 00:00:06,740
Syaratnya, rumahmu tersambung ke IPAL.

4
00:00:07,522 --> 00:00:09,780
Kebanyakan rumah di kota masih memakai tangki septik.

5
00:00:09,950 --> 00:00:11,249
Di kawasan berpipa,

6
00:00:11,376 --> 00:00:13,761
air kamar mandi dan kloset mengalir

7
00:00:13,781 --> 00:00:15,170
ke pipa miring di bawah jalan.

8
00:00:15,687 --> 00:00:18,081
Di IPAL, saringan batang menahan sampah,

9
00:00:18,227 --> 00:00:20,405
pasir diendapkan, lalu kotoran berat

10
00:00:20,425 --> 00:00:21,489
turun di bak yang tenang.

11
00:00:22,285 --> 00:00:24,169
Pekerja terpentingnya justru mikroba.

12
00:00:24,354 --> 00:00:26,068
Udara ditiupkan dari dasar bak,

13
00:00:26,088 --> 00:00:28,139
dan bakteri memakan kotoran yang terlarut.

14
00:00:28,309 --> 00:00:30,212
Di Jakarta, bakteri itu menempel di

15
00:00:30,232 --> 00:00:32,679
potongan plastik kecil yang terus berputar.

16
00:00:32,849 --> 00:00:35,331
Sebagian lumpur bakteri dikembalikan

17
00:00:35,373 --> 00:00:37,089
supaya pekerjanya tetap banyak.

18
00:00:37,592 --> 00:00:39,553
Di IPAL Krukut, BOD,

19
00:00:39,573 --> 00:00:41,055
ukuran kotoran yang mencuri oksigen

20
00:00:41,075 --> 00:00:43,098
sungai, turun dari sekitar seratus

21
00:00:43,118 --> 00:00:44,646
lima puluh menjadi di bawah tiga puluh

22
00:00:44,666 --> 00:00:45,649
miligram per liter.

23
00:00:45,824 --> 00:00:47,074
Setelah didesinfeksi,

24
00:00:47,094 --> 00:00:48,831
air dialirkan ke sungai.

25
00:00:49,341 --> 00:00:51,643
Lebih bersih, tapi tetap bukan air minum.

26
00:00:51,819 --> 00:00:53,413
Ini AUDIRA Explained.
